TERRAFORM:-
    terraform is an open source infrastructure as a code tool developed by hashicorp
    it allows you to crate , manage . & update cloud infrastructure using code instead of manul configruation

USES:-
    1) CREATE LAUNCH INFRASTRUCTURE:-
             launch ec2 instance
             create vpcs
             configure load balancer
             create s3 bucket

    2) INFRASTRUCTURE AUTOMATION:-
             automatically provision server & networking resources

    3) MULTIENVIRNOMENT MANAGMENT:-
               manage develpoment , testing , & production envirnoment

    4) DISASTER RECOVERY:-
              recreate infrastructure quickly using code


FEATURES:-
     1) infrastructure as a code
     2) multicloud support
     3) declarative support
     4) execution plan
     5) state managment
     6) reausable modules
     7) automation fridenly

COMMANDS:-
     1) terraform init
     2) validate
     3) fmt
     4) plan
     5) apply

TERRAFORM INIT:-
        downloads required provider & module

TERRAFORM VALIDATE:-
         checks whether thr terraform configuration is valid

TERRAFORM FMT:-
         formats code according to standard style

TERRAFORM PLAN:-
          shows what changes terraform will make applying them 
          before we create actual infra we can see plan

TERRAFORM APPLY:-
          create or update infrastructure 
        this will execute you code plan
